"rump": "O'Brien made the election a referendum on nuclear power, and the fallout has left the Coalition with {co} seats. The party that governed for most of the past eight decades now has to decide whether it is still a party of government, or just a memory of one.",
"bad": "Ted O'Brien turned the 2028 election into a single-issue referendum on building nuclear reactors across regional Australia. The voters delivered their verdict at the ballot box, and the political meltdown has left the Coalition stranded on {co} seats.",
"mid": "O'Brien's nuclear-and-cost-of-living pitch found an audience, but not quite a majority. The Sunshine Coast's favourite son now has to sell reactors to a crossbench.",
