"GRN_KMTAG": "Better still for {surname}, those {gr} seats hold the balance of power in a hung parliament—giving the Greens their strongest hand in the House since 2010.",
"GRN_MID": "{Leader} gives the Greens a solid lower-house foothold of {gr} seats, holding their inner-city base against both Labor and the independents while keeping real leverage in the Senate, where its {n} senators will matter on every contested bill.",
